    "result_text": "All tests pass (0 failures, 0 errors) and the Maven build exits 0.\n\n## Summary\n\nI replaced the string `membershipTier` with a numeric `membershipLevel` (1\u20133):\n\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a computed `@Transient getMembershipLevel()`: starts at 1, +1 when an email is present, +1 when `namesakeCount == 0`, capped at 3 (level 4 left reserved for tenure).\n- **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 removed the `membershipTier` expression mapping; MapStruct now auto-maps `membershipLevel` from the new getter.\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 replaced the `membershipTier` string property (which drove the generated `OwnerDto`) with an integer `membershipLevel` (min 1, max 3), so the field is dropped from the response and the numeric one added.\n- **`AuditOwnerCreated.java`** \u2014 the create audit line now records `membershipLevel={}` alongside the id it already logged.\n- **`AssignHouseholdMemberCount.java`** \u2014 updated the javadoc that referenced the now-removed GOLD tier.\n\nThe relevant tests (Cp15 level 3, Cp23 level 2 + tier absent, Cp24 capped at 3, Cp21 audit records level) and the full suite are green.",
